      "title": "Tell HN: I unknowingly broke the PHP RCE embargo. I am sorry",
      "description": "I posted here about the then-upcoming PHP RCEs related to CVE-2026-109618 &amp; CVE-2026-109619. I appreciate this has had considerable knock-on effects with the schedule for co-ordinated disclosure, and created additional workload.<p>I am truly sorry. I take full responsibility for my actions.<p>It was not remotely my intention to cause any of the subsequent side effects.<p>At the time of posting, I didn&#x27;t know about any embargo. My contact had told me there was no embargo, and her contact had told her the same thing.<p>As someone who follows the 4-weekly PHP release cycle and compiles it from source, my intention was to alert others in a similar position to be aware of the importance&#x2F;urgency of the updates.<p>That clearly backfired in a pretty wild fashion. I have learned my lesson.",
